achievement("Unexpected savior",v_ac_b2_ch8_savior)
#if(v_combat_technique >= 1) {
The bolt snaps into the eye-slit, punching clean through bone and brain. The orc stiffens, drops his broadsword, and crashes face-first into the dirt.

I cycle the string, scanning the perimeter. The two goblin mages Melindra spotted have yet to show themselves.

Staying here with a loaded crossbow offers little leverage against three interlocking shields, and firing into Daren and Hadrik's melees risks putting an iron tip into my friends.

Do I dive into the melee against the maces, or hunt down the hidden casters before they complete an incantation?
}
#if(v_b2_ch6_crossbow == 1 && v_combat_technique == 0) {
My aim pulls slightly wide, but the reinforced tension drives the bolt through the edge of the iron visor and straight into his skull. The brute collapses into the ferns like a felled tree.

I cycle the string, scanning the perimeter. The two goblin mages Melindra spotted have yet to show themselves.

Staying here with a loaded crossbow offers little leverage against three interlocking shields, and firing into Daren and Hadrik's melees risks putting an iron tip into my friends.

Do I dive into the melee against the maces, or hunt down the hidden casters before they complete an incantation?
}
#if(v_b2_ch6_crossbow == 0 && v_combat_technique == 0 && v_reflexes >= 2) {
The bolt strikes the crown of his helmet and ricochets off the curved steel with a sharp clang.

The orc pivots toward me, eyes burning with fury, and closes the gap in two massive strides. The broadsword comes down in a whistling arc.

My boosted reflexes kick in. I drop beneath the sweep, feeling the wind of the blade ruffle my hair, and drive my enchanted dagger upward through the open neck guard. Steel bites flesh and bone. The orc's weight sags, his weapon tumbling from numb fingers as he hits the turf.

I wrench the blade free, scanning the perimeter. The two goblin mages Melindra spotted have yet to show themselves.

Staying here with a loaded crossbow offers little leverage against three interlocking shields, and firing into Daren and Hadrik's melees risks putting an iron tip into my friends.

Do I dive into the melee against the maces, or hunt down the hidden casters before they complete an incantation?
}
#if(v_b2_ch6_crossbow == 0 && v_b2_ch8_tornado == 0 && v_combat_technique == 0 && v_reflexes < 2) {
The bolt ricochets off his iron helmet with an empty ring.

The orc roars and lunges straight at me. I scramble backward, boots tangling in the roots, and pitch flat onto my back. The heavy broadsword raises high for a downward execution strike.

"Idiot!" Melindra yells.

A compressed gale slams into the orc's chest like a battering ram, flipping him backward into the brush. I scramble up, vault onto his chest, and drive my dagger straight through his visor slit.

I pull the blade out, scanning the perimeter. The two goblin mages Melindra spotted have yet to show themselves.

Staying here with a loaded crossbow offers little leverage against three interlocking shields, and firing into Daren and Hadrik's melees risks putting an iron tip into my friends.

Do I dive into the melee against the maces, or hunt down the hidden casters before they complete an incantation?
}
#if(v_b2_ch6_crossbow == 0 && v_b2_ch8_tornado == 1 && v_combat_technique == 0 && v_reflexes < 2) {
The bolt ricochets off his iron helmet with an empty ring.

The orc roars and lunges straight at me. I scramble backward, boots tangling in the roots, and pitch flat onto my back. The heavy broadsword raises high for a downward execution strike.

"Idiot!" Melindra yells, thrusting her palm out.

The wind sputters. Her knees buckle, her face draining of color as her exhausted reserves seize from the earlier cyclone. The spell collapses before it reaches the orc.

The greatsword drops in a clean, heavy arc, shearing through bone and sinew before I can blink.
}
choice("Fight the orcs and send Flower to look for the goblins.", B2-Ch08a-Assess, v_current_scene = B2-Ch08a-Assess, v_b2_ch8_goblins = 0) if (v_b2_ch6_crossbow == 1 && v_combat_technique == 0 || v_b2_ch8_tornado == 0 && v_combat_technique == 0 || v_combat_technique == 0 && v_reflexes >= 2 || v_combat_technique >= 1)
