ID: B2-Ch08a-Assess
TEXT:

I stow the crossbow and scan the field.

Daren is locked in a fierce exchange with the axe captain. The orc attacks with reckless fury, dual flaming blades raining strikes that force Daren into pure defense. Behind us, Hadrik trades bone-crushing blows with two massive ogres, their iron-banded clubs gouging furrows into the earth.

Leila weaves between three orcs, parrying heavy maces with desperate speed to shield our casters, while Kate and Flower search for an opening through the anti-magic plating.

"Unbelievable!" Arraka's voice screeches from the gemstone. "You brawled with a dragon yesterday and now a handful of armored foot-soldiers has you panicking? Does a coat of seredium baffle you entirely?"

"A pitiful showing," Melindra remarks from the sidelines, leaning against a tree trunk with folded arms. "If basic squad tactics break your formation, Ollendor's royal guard will butcher you inside the gates."

A mace-wielding orc breaks away from Leila and charges Melindra, swinging his iron club for her skull.

Melindra drifts backward an inch above the ground, riding a cushion of air. "Back off! Your fight is over there!"

The orc lunges again, driving his shield forward.

"I said get lost!"

Melindra plants her boots, drops her hips into a low crouch, and tucks her elbows tight against her ribs, palms thrust out.

A violent shockwave explodes from her hands. The blast hurls the orc through the air directly toward Kate, who is channeling frost against Leila's pursuers. Kate dives clear just as the armored body crashes through the boughs where she stood.

"Are you trying to kill us?" Kate roars, pushing herself up from the loam.

"He attacked me unprovoked!" Melindra protests.

"This is a battlefield!" Kate snaps. "If you refuse to fight, fly into the sky and stop sabotaging the line!"

"No need to screech," Melindra mutters. She lifts straight into the air, hovering thirty feet above the canopy while the dazed orc scrambles back toward Leila.

choice("Continue", B2-Ch08a-Goblins, v_current_scene = B2-Ch08a-Goblins) if (v_b2_ch8_goblins == 1)
choice("Continue", B2-Ch08a-Trees, v_current_scene = B2-Ch08a-Trees, v_b2_ch8_goblins = 2) if (v_b2_ch8_goblins == 0 && v_strength >= 3)
