The moment they clear the tree line, I draw my dagger and sprint for the orc Leila already wounded. Before he can wheel around, I drive the blade through the gap under his arm into his chest.

As he collapses, a second orc lunges at me, his spiked mace raised high.
}
#if(v_agility >= 3 && v_b2_ch5_scimitar != 0) {
