#if(v_combat_technique >= 2) {
His posture telegraphs the strike. The raised mace is a feint; his weight shifts forward to drive the shield rim into my throat.

I hold my ground until the last fraction of a second, step inside the bash, and drive my blade into the base of his neck.

With only one orc remaining, Leila slips into his blind spot, severing his jugular with a single fluid strike.

Seeing his squad cut down, the orc captain shoves Daren back, lifts his horn, and blows a piercing note. The ogres retreat as brilliant white light envelops the monsters, their forms vibrating into mist.
}
#if(v_toughness >= 3 && v_combat_technique < 2) {
I lean away from the mace, realizing too late the weapon is a distraction for the incoming shield.

The heavy seredium boss slams into my brow with brutal force. My vision stars, but my boosted skull withstands the impact. I step through the stun and drive my blade across his exposed neck.

With only one orc remaining, Leila slips into his blind spot, severing his jugular with a single fluid strike.

Seeing his squad cut down, the orc captain shoves Daren back, lifts his horn, and blows a piercing note. The ogres retreat as brilliant white light envelops the monsters, their forms vibrating into mist.
}
#if(v_combat_technique < 2 && v_toughness < 3) {
I lean away from the mace, realizing too late the weapon is a distraction for the incoming shield.

The heavy seredium boss slams into my temple with crushing momentum. Bone shatters under the impact, and the world goes black.
}
