choice("Continue", B2-Ch08a-Literally, v_current_scene = B2-Ch08a-Literally)


ID: B2-Ch08a-Funny
TEXT:

"That's funny... Because you were calling me 'half-lessathi' just a few hours ago..." I say, still not taking my eyes off my notebook.

"Right," Melindra says smoothly. "Earlier it slipped my mind. Now it has not."

"Because earlier you had no favors to ask," I say.

"Precisely," Melindra says with a grin. "We understand each other."

"Clearly," I say, turning a leaf in my notes.

"I was curious about something," Melindra says, leaning against a birch trunk. "You are half-lessathi, yet you entered this contest from across the ocean. Lessathi settlements exist exclusively on Varathia. Who were your parents, and why did they cross the sea?"

